  "details": "In the current Open Beta, dragging the VRChat window in Desktop Mode causes the avatar's head to rotate along with the mouse movement\n\nThis did not happen in previous versions\n\nIn the Live version, dragging the window causes everything, including audio, to pause, which is also not ideal\n\nThe behavior in the previous Beta was preferable: audio continued playing while dragging the window, and the avatar's head did not rotate\n\nPlease consider restoring the behavior from the previous Beta",
